        <mxCell id="cnTXnCTJ-hqBZn9qkNSK-5" value="&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600; color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;1. DNS查询&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline; float: none;&quot;&gt;：domainLookupEnd - domainLookupStart；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600; color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;2. TCP连接&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline; float: none;&quot;&gt;：connectEnd - connectStart；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600; color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;3. SSL建连&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline; float: none;&quot;&gt;：requestStart - secureConnectionStart；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600; color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;4. 请求响应&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline; float: none;&quot;&gt;：responseStart - requestStart；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600; color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;5. 内容传输&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline; float: none;&quot;&gt;：responseEnd - responseStart；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600; color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;6. DOM解析&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline; float: none;&quot;&gt;：domInteractive - domLoading；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600; color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;7. 资源加载&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline; float: none;&quot;&gt;：loadEventStart - domInteractive；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600; color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;8. 首屏耗时&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline; float: none;&quot;&gt;：监听页面打开3s内的&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600; color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;首屏&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline; float: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;DOM 变化，并认为 DOM 变化数量最多的那一刻为首屏框架渲染完成时间（sdk初始化后setTimeout 3s收集首屏元素，由于js是在单线程环境下执行，收集时间点可能大于3s）；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600; color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;9. 页面完加载时间&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(44, 62, 80); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline; float: none;&quot;&gt;： 为前面7项数据之和；&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
